  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;INNER SANCTUM (1948 FILM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MOVIE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Inner Sanctum (1948 film) is a 1948 American film noir directed by Lew Landers, based on the Simon &amp; Schuster book series and the 'Inner Sanctum Mystery' radio series. It is the first and only film of M.R.S. productions, the initials of Richard B. Morros, Samuel Rheiner, and Walter Shenson. The film follows a murderer on the run in a small town.")</data>
